# O — units (the Board and its committees, the departments and the teams inside Advancement), the chart, and the decision rights the bylaws and
# policies make public. Departments and teams are as the Foundation's staff page lists them; their sizes are not public.
nodes:
  - id: O:unit/board-of-trustees
    type: unit
    name: Board of Trustees
    summary: The governing body of up to 16 Trustees. Community-led committees with Trustee liaisons (elections, languages, affiliates) work beside it.
